}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Volume measurements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"00b90425-fee4-4587-b0b3-94f579414585"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["BallVolumes",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the ball volume profile {V(0), \[Ellipsis], V(ecc)}, V(r) = \
|B_r(v)|, at a vertex, a list of vertices or All; \"Measure\" chooses the \
convention for the outermost layer"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"bae188a1-2de3-4aa6-97a4-3343584e344b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["ShellAreas",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the shell profile A(r) = V(r) - V(r - 1), the radial \
derivative of BallVolumes under the same measure; Accumulate recovers \
BallVolumes"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e8644788-59f1-487d-9008-ce89f1dc061d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TubeVolumes",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the tube profile T(s) = |{w : d(w, core) <= s}| about a vertex \
list, about the interval I(p, q), or one profile per target"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"a5d2339f-fb81-4c92-98dd-fc89278ccb3e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["LogDifferenceQuotients",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the discrete d log w / d log r of a sequence, q(r) = (log w(r) \
- log w(r - 1)) / (log(r + 1) - log r); a sequence of Around values carries \
its spread into error bars"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"186ba849-1294-4820-8cc6-02d94a322338"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DimensionCurvatureFit",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] dimension and scalar curvature from log-difference quotients \
by regression on r(r + 1), the intercept and the slope, for the ball, sphere, \
tube or tube-mantle probe"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"9bd0c00d-c32e-498b-883f-54777ccedaf0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["VolumeGrowthObservables",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the ball and sphere fits at a vertex over a window as one \
Association: profiles, quotients, fits and the windows used"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"049fc560-ad0e-465d-8ddb-edd6f0732d0d"]
}, Open  ]],

